  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/P1660152.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(34 fotos) Vallat ha vivido este lunes un animado d&iacute;a de las tradicionales paellas, con comida de hermandad en el sal&oacute;n multifuncional. La noche de Vallat de artistas locales pondr&aacute; fin a las fiestas el mi&eacute;rcoles 16 de agosto a las 23 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660110.jpg\" alt=\"p1660110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660112.jpg\" alt=\"p1660112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660114.jpg\" alt=\"p1660114\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660115.jpg\" alt=\"p1660115\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660116.jpg\" alt=\"p1660116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660117.jpg\" alt=\"p1660117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660119.jpg\" alt=\"p1660119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660121.jpg\" alt=\"p1660121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660122.jpg\" alt=\"p1660122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasvallat17/p1660123.jpg\" alt=\"p1660123\" style